  "title": "BLOODMONEY!",
  "type": "HTML",
  "developer": "SHROOMYCHRIST",
  "description": "How far would you go for money? After a hospital visit, a life-saving surgery carries a price tag of $25,000. On the drive home you meet Harvey Harvington, who offers a dollar for every click. Tools in the shop raise your payout by increasing his suffering, and your choices across this short pastel-hued horror clicker lead to one of three endings.",
